#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "fputc, fputs, putc, putchar, puts - output of characters and strings"
msgstr "fputc, fputs, putc, putchar, puts - salida de caracteres y cadenas"

